@startuml
title S2 - Approve or reject a dispatch task (UC-M4-02): DISPATCH_TASK claim interaction contract
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
hide footbox
actor Operator
boundary UI
control Allocation
control Core
Operator -> UI: Choose task and decision
alt Operator approves (optional lower quantity)
  UI -> Allocation: approve_task(task_id, adjusted_qty?)
  Allocation -> Allocation: Check task is RECOMMENDED (BR-M4-08)
  Allocation -> Core: Read fresh hub spaces and vehicle states
  Allocation -> Allocation: Re-check BR-M4-02..06 and BR-M1-01
  alt Conditions still valid
    group Atomic Core-coordinated unit of work (BR-M4-04, BR-M1-01, D-017)
      Allocation -> Core: place_claim(VEHICLE, HolderKind.DISPATCH_TASK, task_id)
      Allocation -> Core: place_claim(SPACE, HolderKind.DISPATCH_TASK, task_id)
      Allocation -> Allocation: Task APPROVED; persist via uow.repository
    end
    Core --> Allocation: Committed (new version)
    Allocation --> UI: APPROVED
  else Conditions changed or a competing claim won
    Allocation -> Core: Roll back (nothing claimed)
    Allocation -> Allocation: Task FAILED with reason code; log
    Allocation --> UI: FAILED (reason), offer to re-plan
  end
else Operator rejects
  UI -> Allocation: reject_task(task_id)
  Allocation -> Allocation: Task REJECTED; log
  Allocation --> UI: REJECTED
end
UI --> Operator: Show result
@enduml
